title: UploadApp
tags: [[TiddlyPWA Docs]]

New wikis created in the sync server control panel automatically serve the server's bundled default app wiki build out of the box without requiring manual uploading.

If you want to manually upload a customized app wiki or initialize a remote slot from here, enter the [[Synchronization]] server endpoint URL and the slot token:

{{$:/plugins/mblackman/tiddlypwa/upload-app-form}}

{{$:/status/TiddlyPWAUploadResult}}

The app wiki uploaded from here will contain TiddlyWiki core {{$:/core!!version}} and TiddlyPWA {{$:/plugins/mblackman/tiddlypwa!!version}}.

Note: when uploading into a slot that is not brand new and untouched (i.e. for recovering from a broken update) you'll need to use the "Clear Auth" button in the admin interface first.

The correct way to update an already running wiki is to [[UpdateInPlace]]!
